    ShadowDB -->|إنشاء فرق| PC

    style PC fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Docker fill:#0db7ed,stroke:#fff,stroke-width:2px
    style RemoteDB fill:#3ecf8e,stroke:#fff,stroke-width:2px
